---
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/main-layout.astro';
import Contact from '@/components/sections/contact.astro';
import Leadership from '@/components/sections/leadership.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '@/config/site';
---
<MainLayout title="About — Healthcare Designer & Maker" description="Meet Abhishek Rawat: a healthcare design lead in Abu Dhabi, AI guild contributor, maker and skydiving coach.">
  <div class="shell"><header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A little about me</p><h1>A designer’s eye.<br/><span class="serif-accent">A builder’s curiosity.</span></h1></header>
    <div class="about-grid"><div class="about-copy"><p>I’m Abhishek Rawat, a Lead UX Designer based in Abu Dhabi. My work sits at the intersection of clinical workflows, patient experiences and the systems that connect them.</p><p>At Malaffi, I work on the patient-facing experience of Abu Dhabi’s Health Information Exchange. Healthcare asks a lot of design: clarity across complex information, consideration for different languages, and respect for the people on both sides of care.</p><p>I’m also part of our internal AI guild. My work includes an AI-assisted upgrade of our Figma design system to Code Connect, a RAG-powered knowledge repository and chatbot, and content pipelines in Strapi.</p><p>What interests me is how these tools change the way a team works: how quickly we can test an idea, how clearly we preserve intent, and how confidently we can review what we build.</p><p>Outside that work, I design and 3D-print things, build with microcontrollers, and coach skydiving. Making physical things keeps me curious about attention, feedback and the gap between how a system looks and how it behaves.</p><a class="button-primary" href={siteConfig.links.resume} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-track="Resume">View my résumé ↗</a></div><figure class="about-photo"><span class="portrait-monogram" aria-hidden="true">ar.</span><figcaption><strong>A person behind the pixels.</strong>Portrait placeholder · replace with an authentic photo from the studio or workshop.</figcaption></figure></div>
    <section class="section-space"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Experience & contribution</p><h2>Close to the problem.<br/><span class="serif-accent">Close to the making.</span></h2></div></div><div class="experience-row"><span>Current / Abu Dhabi</span><div><h3>Lead UX Designer</h3><p>Malaffi / Department of Health, Abu Dhabi</p><p>Patient experiences, clinical information and bilingual interface design. Connecting design decisions with product and engineering.</p><a href="/work/malaffi-health-portal" class="text-link">Explore the healthcare work <span class="link-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><div class="experience-row"><span>Alongside product work</span><div><h3>AI guild & team enablement</h3><p>Design systems connected to code, knowledge tooling and content operations. Exploring how AI can support repeatable delivery with human review.</p><a href="/work/ai-design-delivery" class="text-link">Explore the workflow story <span class="link-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><div class="experience-row"><span>Independent practice</span><div><h3>Maker & skydiving coach</h3><p>Physical prototypes and real-world constraints. Building an altimeter and a desktop bus tracker with AI assistance as part of the development process.</p><a href="/builds" class="text-link">Visit the workshop <span class="link-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  </div><Leadership /><Contact />
</MainLayout>
